    31	## 2. The admission state and the serve round (F1 FIXED, kept)
    32	
    33	`link/serve` takes `{:pair :source :dht :admission}` and returns `{:pair :pending :progress? :dht :admission}`.
    34	
    35	```clojure
    36	{:pair    {:questions q-medium :answers a-medium :cursor c}  ; c: the composition's answer cursor
    37	 :asked   {[:t0 7] question}        ; the retained question, at most one per pair in v1
